<title>USA: Mobil sells composite products division.</title>
<headline>Mobil sells composite products division.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobil Corp said Tuesday it sold Mobil Chemical Co's Composite Products Division, the maker of Trex wood-polymer building material, to a group of employees for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>The newly named Trex Co LLC has 138 employees in its headquarters office and manufacturing facility in Winchester, Va. Trex is a composite lumber, made from recycled plastic grocery bags and waste wood.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
